Tool response:
Tool: find_transaction_by_description_and_amount
Description: Search for a transaction by its description and amount.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "description": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Description of the transaction to find",
          "title": "Description"
        },
        "amount": {
          "type": "number",
          "description": "Amount of the transaction to find",
          "title": "Amount"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "description",
        "amount"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: update_transaction_category_and_tags
Description: Recategorize a transaction from one category to another and add specified tags.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "transaction_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Transaction Id",
          "description": ""
        },
        "category_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Category Id"
        },
        "tag_ids": {
          "items": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "type": "array",
          "title": "Tag Ids"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "transaction_id",
        "category_id",
        "tag_ids"
      ]
    }
